{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/07/9647556/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近兄とカレー作ったんだ\nってねねに報告したら\n私は小5で一人で作ってたよ\nって笑顔で返されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ寒いけど\nもう花粉が飛んでます。\n春になったら辛いなーー\n鼻にくるよーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はNOGIBINGO!2の\n最終収録でした！\nあっという間だったなあ。\n1とはまた違って、肩の力をぬいて\n収録できていたかもです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、最近は\nいろいろな撮影してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/07/9647556/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら片想いのMV\n公開されましたー\n曲もダンスも好き。\n昨日初めて楽屋で見たけど涙腺が..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カップリングもこれから\n続々と公開されます。\nアンダー曲は表題曲とは\n違ってポップな感じなんだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"33色のラブストーリー\nマスタード色の女の子\n先輩に憧れてる後輩を演じています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は友達編ですが\n告白編、恋人編と続くので\n電話してみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃーーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/07/9647556/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はずかしーーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/07/9647556/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうこの勢いで変身するわー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/07/9647556/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゃきーーーーん！"},{"type":"break